@startuml
title SplitSmart Component Architecture (proposed)
left to right direction
package "Java Swing MVP" {
 [Swing presentation] as UI
 [GUI-independent application use cases] as App
 [Domain: expense, approval, ledger, payment] as Domain
 [MVP adapters: persistence / receipt / notice] as Adapters
 UI --> App
 App --> Domain
 App --> Adapters
}
package "Complete product (proposed)" {
 [Web client] as Web
 [Android client] as Droid
 [iOS client] as Apple
 [Authenticated shared service] as API
 [Identity boundary] as Id
 [Transactional records] as DB
 [Private receipt store] as Files
 [Outbox and notification adapter] as Outbox
 [Authorized report queries] as Reports
 Web --> API
 Droid --> API
 Apple --> API
 API --> Id
 API --> DB
 API --> Files
 API --> Outbox
 API --> Reports
 Reports --> DB
}
note bottom of API
Proposed logical boundary; no API, database, backend, or client
is verified as implemented.
end note
@enduml
